<title>USA: Micron files shelf for $1 bln in debt, stock.</title>
<headline>Micron files shelf for $1 bln in debt, stock.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micron Technology Inc said on Friday that it filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $1 billion in common stock and debt securities.</p>
</text>
